@startuml
!include style.iuml
' Seat assignment and enforcement (Module 9): LabsController POST /api/labs/{labId}/workstations
' (Admin,SuperAdmin; 409 duplicate machine number, 400 invalid IP, audit WORKSTATION_CREATED),
' ExamsController PUT /api/exams/{examId}/assignments/{userId}/workstation (Teacher,Admin,SuperAdmin; EligibilityPage;
' 409 seat taken, audit WORKSTATION_ASSIGNED), student/start -> CheckSeatOnStartAsync (SeatGuard.RefusesClient: 403
' DESKTOP_CLIENT_REQUIRED when Exams:RequireDesktopClientForStart, default true; SeatGuard.Check by SeatMatch =
' MachineName | Ip | Either; ReportMismatchAsync audits SEAT_MISMATCH and pushes ViolationEvent),
' MonitoringController.Heartbeat (re-check; a SeatMismatch event only if none with the same payload within
' SeatMismatchDedupWindow = 5 min, and only while the session is InProgress).
' Printed pt = fontSize * 72 * printed_width_in / png_width_px.
skinparam dpi 96
skinparam defaultFontSize 28
skinparam ArrowFontSize 27
skinparam padding 1
skinparam swimlane {
  BorderColor #777777
  TitleFontSize 29
}

|Staff (Web Panel)|
start
:Admin / SuperAdmin (LabsPage)
adds a workstation:
MachineNumber, HostName,
IpAddress;
|Server|
if (LabsController: number\nunique in lab, IP valid?) then ([no])
  :409 / 400;
  stop
else ([yes])
  :Save, audit
  WORKSTATION_CREATED;
endif
|Staff (Web Panel)|
:Teacher / Admin (EligibilityPage)
picks the seat: PUT
.../assignments/{userId}/workstation;
|Server|
if (Seat taken by another\nstudent in this exam?) then ([yes])
  :409 Conflict;
  stop
else ([no])
  :Save WorkstationId, audit
  WORKSTATION_ASSIGNED;
endif
|Desktop App (Student)|
:POST /api/exams
/student/start;
|Server|
if (Desktop client\ntoken?) then ([no])
  :403 DESKTOP_CLIENT_
  REQUIRED;
  stop
else ([yes])
endif
:SeatGuard.Check: machine claim
or request IP (SeatMatch setting);
if (EnforceSeat and\nseat differs?) then ([yes])
  :403 SEAT_MISMATCH,
  audit SEAT_MISMATCH,
  hub ViolationEvent;
  stop
else ([no])
  :Create ExamSession
  (InProgress);
endif
repeat
  |Desktop App (Student)|
  :POST heartbeat
  (every 10 s);
  |Server|
  if (SeatGuard.Check: mismatch\nnot recorded in last 5 min?) then ([yes])
    :SeatMismatch event,
    audit SEAT_MISMATCH,
    hub ViolationEvent;
  else ([no])
  endif
repeat while (Session\nInProgress?) is ([yes]) not ([no])
stop
@enduml
